      ],
      "text": "challenging as they require updating national essential medicine lists and building",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        168.4229278564453,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "consensus at national level.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.1114196777344,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Establishing national standards for hospital care for children is critical in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.03289794921875,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "improving quality of care and is a major component of the quality improvement",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.12286376953125,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "process. Countries will be encouraged to set up national technical working groups",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.1329345703125,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "to support the national adaptation process with the involvement of all stakeholders.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.0728454589844,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "The standards will then be adapted and endorsed by stakeholders, locally translated",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.1029968261719,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "as required, and disseminated to all hospitals in the country. In most cases, it may",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.0830993652344,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "require orientation of the health workers on the new case management protocols as",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        250.7529754638672,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "part of the quality of care improvement process.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
